{"id":"Wc79b10e7d07f0d3a91b283f4","zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","en":"","name":"列车-轨道-基础结构","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","families":[],"definition_zh":"由列车、轨道和轨下基础结构共同组成的动力相互作用系统。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wc79b10e7d07f0d3a91b283f4","text":"列车-轨道-基础结构","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3191a419fc61d30540e3","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"摘要:铁路工程混凝土结构疲劳损伤演化的数值实现是列车-轨道-基础结构系统动态性能预测的重要基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S1da693d6db11d0568955","source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于铁路列车-轨道-基础结构系统统一分析模型,引入无砟轨道混凝土类、黏弹性类材料的疲劳损伤本构关系,建立列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型,较为系统地开展无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W50559061a6005613993826a8","name":"Train-track-substructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W50559061a6005613993826a8","name":"Train-track-substructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W50559061a6005613993826a8","name":"Train-track-substructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用